description "Nite Owl Mandalorian

Eagle-eyed sharpshooters with Jetpacks.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibroknife (Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- 60% shorter

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (0)
-- Extra Regen: 1/5s
- Beskar (2)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
-- Rocket ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS3]"